{"id":"ce50b9a751a8ba69","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Order Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism — ZFC Order11 Order Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism","58-df-zfc-order6-order-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism — ZFC Order11 Order Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-order-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism — ZFC Order11 Order Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;P,\\leq_P;Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;P,\\leq_P;Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;X,R;Y,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;X,R;Y,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both carrier sets and both order relations are now explicit arguments.</li>\n<li>The order6 order-isomorphism variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)$ and $\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;P,\\leq_P;Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_Q,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P,Q)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderIsomorphism}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S(f;X,R;Y,S).","display":true}],"bytes":1520,"backlinks":[{"id":"0356d8ecaaf34dec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S$ (order-isomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"8cc82b21370b435c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2896","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["2aa29158e60b337f","d583890235faf0d5"]}